WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.514 --> 00:00:08.993
Every objective has four parts: Audience, Behaviour, Condition and Degree.

2
00:00:08.993 --> 00:00:17.709
Let's try a common trainee objective: "understand", "with minimal support".

3
00:00:17.709 --> 00:00:25.658
Red squares show what is missing. "Understand" cannot be seen, and "minimal support" cannot be measured.

4
00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:33.151
Use a verb you can observe for the skill. For listening: identify, point to, match or tick.

5
00:00:33.151 --> 00:00:39.542
Then give the Degree a number.

6
00:00:39.542 --> 00:00:44.908
All five squares are green: Specific, Measurable, Achievable, Relevant and Time-bound.

7
00:00:44.908 --> 00:00:50.041
Success criteria for pupils are written for you, as "I can…" statements.

8
00:00:50.041 --> 00:00:56.157
The sentence below shows the whole objective exactly as it will appear in your RPH.

9
00:00:56.158 --> 00:01:01.438
Prefer to write it in your own words? Press Type it myself. Consilia still checks it.

10
00:01:01.438 --> 00:01:05.070
Add a complementary objective the same way. Next: watch "Teach mode".
